message: >-
  If you reference this project, please cite it using the metadata below.
title: >-
  Bosch Production Line Performance — Failure Detection & Decision System
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Anudeep Reddy
    family-names: Mutyala
repository-code: >-
  https://github.com/anudeepreddy332/bosch-production-line-defect-analysis
url: https://bosch.themachinist.org
license: MIT
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-07-03"
abstract: >-
  A production-style ML decision system for detecting manufacturing failures in the Bosch
  Production Line Performance dataset (~0.58% failure rate), built around leakage-safe features,
  an honestly measured operating range, cost-based decision thresholds, and label-free production
  monitoring. A separate, fully quarantined Kaggle leaderboard-optimization track measures and
  attributes how much of the dataset's competition leaderboard performance comes from mechanisms
  that are not deployable in production.
keywords:
  - machine-learning
  - manufacturing
  - anomaly-detection
  - decision-systems
  - mlops
